  "about": {
    "zh": "星眠,一个 Q 版羊娘,二头身,四分之三侧身朝画面右边站;戴着白色毛绒羊角兜帽,兜帽两侧有棕色羊角、垂着两只带粉色心形的白色羊耳,兜帽上缀着粉色蝴蝶结和金色小星星;金色头发、额前刘海,两条金色麻花辫从耳后垂到胸前,辫尾系粉色发圈;戴深色大圆框眼镜,粉色眼睛;穿浅蓝色短款蓬蓬连衣裙,粉色波浪荷叶边披肩,白色围裙,袖口是带金色菱形的白色毛绒饰边;白色短裤,白色毛绒袜口系粉色蝴蝶结,浅蓝色鞋子;坐下时抱膝坐",
    "en": "Xingmian, a chibi sheep girl two heads tall, standing three-quarters on facing right; a fluffy white hood with brown ram horns on the sides, two drooping white sheep ears with pink hearts, pink bows and little gold stars on the hood; blonde hair with a fringe and two blonde braids falling from behind the ears to the chest, tied with pink bands; big dark round glasses and pink eyes; a short puffy light-blue dress with a pink frilled capelet, a white apron and white fluffy cuffs with gold diamonds; white shorts, white fluffy socks with pink bows and light-blue shoes; she sits hugging her knees"
  },
